Comment:
 At its first start the service downloads the model EmbeddingGemma 2
 (google/embeddinggemma-2 in the ONNX export onnx-community/embeddinggemma-2-ONNX,
 Apache-2.0) and the Python packages it runs on, each pinned with its SHA-256 in
 /usr/share/valbum-embedder/model.json and requirements.txt: numpy
 (BSD-3-Clause), onnxruntime (MIT), flatbuffers (Apache-2.0), packaging
 (Apache-2.0 or BSD-2-Clause), protobuf (BSD-3-Clause), tokenizers (Apache-2.0)
 and pillow (MIT-CMU). None of them is part of this package.
